## Proposed Changes

### 1. Types & Data Contract

#### [MODIFY] [types/index.ts](file:///d:/finance-fund-main/src/features/pengajuan/types/index.ts)
* Memastikan tipe TypeScript mendefinisikan interface baru yang persis dengan struktur mock final di atas:
  ```typescript
  export type RKAStatusPencairan = "dicairkan" | "belum_cair" | "hangus";

  export interface ItemBudgetBulan {
    bulan: string;
    budget: number;
    realisasi?: number;
    status?: RKAStatusPencairan;
    catatan?: string | null;
  }

  export type RKACategory =
    | "kelompok_group"
    | "kelompok"
    | "kegiatan"
    | "sub-kegiatan"
    | "sub_kegiatan";

  export interface RKANode {
    id: string;
    name: string;
    category: RKACategory;
    isHasBudget?: boolean;
    children?: RKANode[];
    list_budget?: ItemBudgetBulan[];
  }

  export interface RKADocument {
    id: string;
    name: string;
    tahun: number;
    unit?: string;
    list_item: RKANode[];
  }
  ```

